.TH tuzip n 0.23.0 tclutils "Tcl Library Procedures"
.SH NAME
tuzip \- Small ZIP helper written in pure Tcl.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
.nf
package require tclutils::tuzip
.fi
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
.nf
::tclutils::tuzip::entries archive.zip
::tclutils::tuzip::names archive.zip
::tclutils::tuzip::readMember archive.zip member/name.txt
::tclutils::tuzip::extract archive.zip member/name.txt out.txt
::tclutils::tuzip::create archive.zip $files \-base $directory \-compress 1
.fi
.SH NOTES
.PP
\fBtuzip\fR currently supports stored entries and deflated entries. This is enough
.PP
for common ZIP files and for inspecting ODF files such as \fB.odt\fR, \fB.ods\fR, \fB.odg\fR
.PP
and \fB.odp\fR, because those files are ZIP containers.
.PP
Binary files are always opened in binary mode.

